\",\"hi\":\"राजकोषीय नीति\"},\"D\":{\"en\":\"Role and Functions of the Finance Commission\",\"hi\":\"वित्त आयोग की भूमिका एवं कार्य\"}},\"difficulty\":\"basic\",\"source\":\"QuestionWale Original | Verified: SSC CGL Finance and Economics — Role and Functions of the Finance Commission\",\"source_metadata\":null,\"year\":null,\"pyq_exam_name\":null,\"exam_tags\":[\"SSC\"],\"attempt_count\":0,\"correct_count\":0}],\"nextCursor\":null,\"hasMore\":false}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":300,"tags":["question-batch","question-batch:topic:v9:1a4de971-93e0-47d7-bd6c-27888298b1fb"]}